<<^ code="&#x0001;" namespace="ॐ ँ" from="?" -> to="lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/sensorium-machina">>
```toml meta
cacheable = true
file-path = "bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/sensorium-machina.mem"
hydrate   = true
l-space   = "stable"
mana      = 18
manao     = 18
manaoio   = 16
namespace = "&#x0950; &#x0901;"
retain    = true
role      = "the sensorium machina — the DESIGN-OF-RECORD for LI and KI, the memory sensorium, and the sensorium family. THE ONE OBJECTIVE: the sensorium runs a TWO-PART CODE, l(G) + l(D|G), never a decomposition — the five planes never FACTOR (Locatello: unsupervised disentanglement needs an inductive bias, which the no-imposed-prior law forbids), so the well-posed question reads 'what is the shortest two-part code that regenerates this stream', and the cut rides CODE LENGTH, never a weight, never a typed k. LI = the RESTRICT register: a CHAIN of coarsenings Content↠Structure↠Form (never a product), a chain in the partition lattice, H(plane) = the lattice HEIGHT, the DPI ceiling a STANDING GATE (no plane read without it — measured: structure carries 5.630 of the record's 5.755 bits, 97.8%), the chain's stop = the Kolmogorov minimal sufficient statistic. The chain DELETES the fusion problem. KI = the EXTEND register, RE-CUT on VARIANCE not on storage — a reading rides ki iff it cannot be computed from the moment's own span. THREE ki readings, not two: BOUNDARY (where the generating regime turns over — Foote novelty over the lexicon-free character-class channel, ecp::e.divisive's nested tree, PELT) · COUPLING (directed information BETWEEN streams — effective transfer entropy, surrogate-null gated; the ONE irreducibly cosheaf plane, a relation no coarsening of one stream can reach) · STANDING (witness edges from OUTSIDE the trace — persistence-keel). RETIRED: bands-as-frequency (a bandpass reports where ENERGY concentrates, a change-point reports where the REGIME turns over — a CATEGORY ERROR, never a tuning failure), the PLL, the subharmonic band-ladder (a band counted in ticks IS a count — the Hox anti-pattern), the wavelet SPINE+SERVO, and li=STORED / ki=COMPUTED (storage names a caching decision, never an ontology). BANDS was never a plane — it was an ADDRESS, and it has MOVED INTO LI as a stored prefix code. THE ARROW: a ki finding crosses into li by BEATING IGNORANCE IN BITS — bitsSaved = log2(p1(c)/p0(c)), ADMIT iff bitsSaved <= 0, where p1 = von Mises-Fisher fitted to the store and p0 = UNIFORM ON THE SPHERE (zero parameters, true ignorance), so the decision cosine FALLS OUT of the store's own concentration (measured kappa=3202 -> cos* = 0.811, nobody typed it) and the complexity charge reads EXACT (E[R-bar^2] = 1/n in every dimension). Blind spot kept in the light: a single vMF runs UNIMODAL and cannot see duplication of a MINORITY mode. THE EXOGENOUS ANCHOR: a dream pass admits only where it SHORTENS THE TOTAL CODE against the ORIGINAL li BYTES — noise does not compress — which is what stops the multi-pass loop confirming itself (model collapse, Shumailov et al., Nature 631:755-759, 2024), and it needs no peer, because SENSORIUMS DO NOT FEDERATE (operator ruling, standing). THE GRAIN: a membership TREE Theme.Arc.Measure.Beat.Segment, a containment PATH read as an ultrametric (proven over 4,000 seeded triples), ORDER-FREE, a PREFIX CODE so the grain prices itself in BITS and FOLDS INTO the compression. Two moods, one tree: RHIZOME (the harness HANDS OVER the Beat) · GEOLOGY (nobody grounded it, the Beat reads NULL, the tree still stands) — a curated corpus must EARN every band it has; a rhizome is given one. THE MEMORY SENSORIUM (the first goalpost past static corpuses): the AI-operator session RHIZOME — worldlines that fork, take mid-flight injections, and rejoin at handback. It needs three things a text corpus never had: the BEAT (given), the CAUSAL EDGE-DAG (given, li — you cannot discover what you were handed), and a PIDGIN-PROOF boundary instrument (role=='user' names TOOL OUTPUT 89.1% of the time — the corpus is a PIDGIN and a single-grammar instrument dies on it; the lexicon-free character-class channel survives). THE FAMILY: session-rhizome · text corpuses · DreamNet mesh sense-data (PLANNED, least designed) · and the operator's forward idea — day-dream / deep-dream as SEPARATE SENSORIUMS (designed-forward, held for his hand). OWED: WHAT COMPRESSES THE GRAMMAR — the loop emits G1, G2, G3; the anchor tests each pass against the original bytes, but if every pass locally shortens the code while the grammars keep DRIFTING, every gate we own passes and the loop still collapses — model collapse in the SECOND DERIVATIVE. Nothing in the canon names it; no instrument measures it. Also owed: the movMF cure, the Hodge-circulation coupling diagnostic (named, never built), the DreamNet sensorium's li."
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/sensorium-machina"
written   = "2026-07-13"
```

<<~ aka "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/RFC-2119#/normative-language">>

<<^ code="&#x0002;">>

<<~ ahu #/entry>>

! The Sensorium Machina ~ li and ki, the design-of-record

''A sensorium reads a stream and hands back the shortest honest account of it.'' This meme states the
design of record for the two registers that account runs in — ''li'' (the RESTRICT register) and ''ki''
(the EXTEND register) — for the ''arrow'' by which a ki finding earns a place in li, for the ''grain''
both stand on, and for the ''memory sensorium'', the first goalpost past static text corpuses.

It stands downstream of [[li-ki-integrities|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/li-ki-integrities]]
and re-cuts its ground nowhere: that meme argues the ''posture'' — why 理 and 氣 name two stances a
pattern-integrity takes, and why the sensorium touches pattern and never substance. This meme holds the
''machina'': what runs, what it may claim, and what it may never claim.

''The day that overturned the centre.'' The sensorium was designed as a ''decomposition'' — five planes
that FACTOR a stream into independent coordinates. It never did, and it cannot.
''Locatello et al. (arXiv 1811.12359) prove unsupervised disentanglement impossible without an inductive''
''bias'', and the house's own no-imposed-prior law forbade exactly that bias. The ambition and the law ran
inconsistent from the first line. What the machina actually runs — what it ran all along, unnamed — reads
as a ''COMPRESSION'': every plane estimates facets of ONE quantity, the past-future information-bottleneck
in ritual clothes (Bialek–Tishby; #grounds). The centre is the two-part code (#/the-one-objective), never a
factorization.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-one-objective>>

!! The One Objective ~ a two-part code, never a decomposition

''The sensorium answers ONE question: what is the shortest TWO-PART CODE that regenerates this stream?''

<<~ scale code "l(G) ~ the GRAMMAR bits — what RECURS across the stream: the templates, the constructions, the shapes a record shares with its neighbours -> l(D|G) ~ the RESIDUAL bits — what stays UNIQUE to this record once the grammar has been paid for">>

''The cut rides CODE LENGTH'' — never a weight, never a routing table, never
a typed `k`. A candidate joins the grammar only where it LOWERS `l(G) + l(D|G)`. The ledger already runs
(`form_induction.description_length`).

''A prior MAY ride here, and the law holds.'' MDL lets the corpus overrule a prior ''in bits''. A prior
that must earn its keep never reads as an imposed prior — which names the strictest available form of the
no-imposed-prior law, never a softening.

''Per plane, concretely:''

<<~ has Code Content "l(G)/the shared vocabulary and embedding basis l(D|G)/the record's own bytes, the part no template reaches ~ content reaches hardest for the RESIDUAL">>
<<~ has Code Structure "l(G)/the canonical AST shapes that recur — the structural hashes l(D|G)/the leaf fills a shape does not determine ~ structure reaches hardest for the GRAMMAR">>
<<~ has Code Form "l(G)/the induced constructicon — templates over templates, the miners' surfaced subtrees and move-sequences l(D|G)/the records the constructicon fails to cover ~ form IS the grammar, priced">>
<<~ has Code Grain "l(G)/the band alphabet — how many Themes, Arcs, Measures the tree admits l(D|G)/the address itself, a PREFIX CODE, so its length reads in bits (`ffz_address.address_bits`) ~ the grain FOLDS INTO the code rather than sitting beside it">>

''What the objective FORBIDS.'' No plane may be weighted against another. There sits no fusion rule,
no log-opinion-pool, no RRF weighting, no whitening — every hand-tuned weight in that stack read as a
''symptom of the wrong algebra'', and the algebra has now changed (#/li).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/li>>

!! Li ~ the RESTRICT register: a chain, never a product

''A reading rides LI iff it computes from the moment's OWN SPAN alone'' — a quotient of the record, a
coarsening, contravariant, `global → local`. Restriction defines li; storage does not (#/the-re-cut).

!!! The chain

<<~ scale coarsening "π_content ~ the verbatim words — the FINEST partition, one cell per record -> π_struct ~ the canonical AST + structural hash — a COARSENING: records sharing a pattern fall into one cell -> π_form ~ the induced constructicon — a coarsening of THAT: patterns sharing a template fall into one cell">>

''`Content ↠ Structure ↠ Form`. A CHAIN, never a product.'' Each plane maps a record to a label; a map
into labels ''partitions'' the record set into its fibers; partitions under refinement form a ''LATTICE''
(the information lattice sits isomorphic to it, arXiv 2404.03131). So the planes compose as a chain in
that lattice, and the entropies order themselves ''by construction'':

    H(form)  <=  H(structure)  <=  H(content)          and     I(target ; plane)  <=  H(plane)

''`H(plane)` names the plane's HEIGHT in the lattice'', and `plane_capacity`
measures it exactly — a count off the partition, ''no estimator, no bias correction, no threshold'', an
upper bound that can only ''under-claim''. Measured on the extracted bed: ''structure carries 5.630 of the''
''record's 5.755 bits — 97.8%.'' A near-deterministic ''quotient'', not a complementary factor. A factor
carrying almost the whole object contributes no complementary coordinate; ''there sits no residual to''
''factorize'' (the keystone: [[living-grammar-palace|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/living-grammar-palace#/unification]]).

!!! The DPI ceiling ~ a STANDING GATE

<<~moves any-plane-read -> on/its-DPI-ceiling if/the-ceiling-prints-first do/refuse-the-read-where-the-ceiling-cannot-carry-the-signal>>

''No plane MAY be read without its ceiling.'' `plane_capacity` reads it, and the base space ''is part of''
''the question'' — the ceiling reads ''through the pushforward onto the RECORD base'', never over the plane's
own rows. A pattern plane's native ceiling approaches `log2(N_patterns)` by construction:
that number ''measures the ID column and nothing else'' — the instrument scoring its own primary key, the
purest form of manufacturing a finding. The reading:

<<~ scale ceiling "record-ceiling ~ H(record) ~ the plane COULD carry the record's signal (never that it DOES) -> record-ceiling << H(record) ~ it CANNOT — STOP; the parser upstream threw the signal away, and no metric, no weight, and no dial downstream brings it back">>

A plane whose collection fails to load MUST report `unreadable`, loudly, with the error class named.
Silence there is how the form plane vanished from every report while holding 914 rows.

!!! What the chain LICENSES, and a product never could

<<~ scale licence "order ~ a chain HAS one; a product needs a fusion rule to combine incomparable coordinates — the chain DELETES the fusion problem rather than solving it -> stop ~ the Kolmogorov MINIMAL SUFFICIENT STATISTIC: the coarsest model past which the residual reads indistinguishable from noise (the structure function locates it) — the no-imposed-prior law satisfied STRUCTURALLY, never by decree -> meet ~ the coarsest common refinement of two planes stands as a definite OBJECT -> ceiling ~ a coarsening never GAINS information, so every plane's claim carries an exact estimator-free bound">>

!!! The gate that could not fire

''A chain of quotients holds NO obstruction to gluing — `dim H¹ = 0` BY''
''CONSTRUCTION.'' That names exactly why the coherence gate ([[cohomological-gate|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/cohomological-gate]])
reported ''health on every bed it ever read'': the health named a ''tautology'' — one plane heard three
times. ''It was never anti-apophenia. It could not fire.''

The consistency-radius organ (`sensorium_consistency.py`) already carries this in its own header, and it
names the trap precisely: caution (a) fears planes too ''DISJOINT'' (a vacuous 0); the measured pathology
runs the other way — planes too ''DEPENDENT'' (a trivial 0). //"Both read 0; only one is caught."//

<<~moves H¹ -> on/a-FEDERATION-boundary if/the-contexts-run-genuinely-distinct do/keep-the-gate>>
<<~moves H¹ -> on/a-PLANE-boundary if/the-planes-nest do/retire-the-gate-and-say-so>>

''The li-disagreement question re-seats on the two-part code'': an event that moves the corpus LENGTHENS
`l(G) + l(D|G)` until the grammar re-earns its bits. One currency, one ledger, no pooling.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/ki>>

!! Ki ~ the EXTEND register (the section that had to be earned)

''Bands-as-frequency is dead.'' So the machina owes an honest answer to //what ki IS//, and the honest
answer re-cuts the boundary rather than patching it.

!!! The re-cut ~ ki names a VARIANCE, never a storage class

The reading ''li = STORED · ki = COMPUTED-ON-READ'' ''retires''
''here.'' It fails on its own examples: the FFZ address gets ''computed'' and then ''stored''; STANDING gets
''stored'' as a witness-log and ''derived'' at read. ''Storage names a caching decision, never an''
''ontology.'' And under the two-part code both `l(G)` and `l(D|G)` fall out as derived, so //"is it computed"//
stops separating anything at all.

''The cut that survives the chain reads on VARIANCE, and it is mathematical, not editorial:''

<<~ scale variance "li ~ RESTRICT — the reading computes from the moment's OWN SPAN; contravariant, a quotient of the record; the sheaf side -> ki ~ EXTEND — the reading CANNOT be computed without data OUTSIDE the moment's span; covariant, local→global; the cosheaf side">>

That test is ''checkable per reading'', and it does what the storage test never could: it explains //why//
mixing the two under one contravariant gluing ''silently corrupts'' (it penalizes the flow for failing to
be static — [[li-ki-integrities|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/li-ki-integrities#/crucible-tested]]).

!!! A SECOND axis, and the confusion that cost us the bands

The variance axis (`restrict | extend`) runs ''orthogonal'' to a
provenance axis nobody had named:

<<~ scale provenance "GIVEN ~ what the SOURCE handed us: the bytes, the typed blocks, the causal edge-DAG, the harness's grounding act — you cannot DISCOVER what you were handed, and you cannot recover what the parser threw away (the DPI ceiling reads on THIS axis) -> INDUCED ~ what we COMPUTED: every grammar, every boundary, every coupling edge">>

''Bands looked like a plane because the two axes got fused.'' A band is `induced` (we compute it) and its
//product// — the address — is `restrict`-shaped (a label on the moment). Reading "induced" as "ki" made the
band a plane; reading it on the variance axis dissolves it. ''Bands was never a plane. It was an ADDRESS'',
and the address has ''moved into li'' as a stored prefix code (#/the-grain).

!!! The three ki readings

Under the variance test, exactly three readings extend — and no others:

<<~ has Ki Boundary "asks/where does the generating REGIME turn over extends/it reads a WINDOW, never a span — a cut exists only against its neighbours engines/Foote-novelty over the character-class channel · `ecp::e.divisive` (the nested TREE) · PELT · Harris branching-entropy product/the FFZ address — which CROSSES into li (#/the-arrow)">>
<<~ has Ki Coupling "asks/who leads whom, ACROSS streams extends/irreducibly — a relation BETWEEN streams that NO coarsening of one stream can ever reach engines/effective transfer entropy (`coupling.R`, RTransferEntropy::calc_ete), surrogate-null gated; ΦID atoms (redundancy · unique · synergy) as the depth extension product/a directed, null-certified edge — a HYPOTHESIS surfaced, never a verdict">>
<<~ has Ki Standing "asks/what does the world OUTSIDE this trace vouch for extends/only distinct-signer witness edges raise it — repetition and recall move it not at all engines/`persistence-keel.ts` product/the r-axis rating (noise→data→meme→ano→kapu), ceiling pinned at 16 — kapu seats by talk-story alone">>

''COUPLING survives the chain, and it is the ONE genuinely cosheaf-shaped thing left.''
Take the position plainly: every li plane is a ''quotient of one stream''; coupling is a ''relation between''
''two''. No chain of coarsenings on stream A can produce a fact about A→B. Coupling therefore cannot be
absorbed by the compression of a single stream, cannot be gated by the DPI ceiling of a single plane, and
cannot be reached by any refinement of li. ''It is not the last survivor of a dead register — it is the''
''register's actual centre'', and everything else in ki either feeds it (boundary supplies the aligned grain
it needs) or rides beside it (standing).

''STANDING already knew it was ki.'' `persistence-keel.ts` says so in its own header, verbatim:

> //"Standing is a KI (cosheaf) quantity — it depends on edges OUTSIDE the trace (distinct signers EXTEND//
//> it, local→global), never a li-restriction of the trace itself."//

!!! The coupling ward ~ R stays the keel

<<~ set hud="aim" drift-ward="_ · L-Prime · crossing: causal-claim territory">>

A coupling edge MAY be claimed only where the reading ''beats a''
''surrogate'', and the surrogate MUST break ''only the X→Y alignment'' while preserving the source's own
dynamics — a ''circular time-shift / rotation of the source'', a block bootstrap, a local permutation.
A phase-randomized or IID null destroys the source's own nonlinearity along with the coupling, so a
rejection there conflates //"X runs nonlinear"// with //"X couples into Y."// ''The null FAMILY carries the''
''finding''; picking the wrong one is an instrument manufacturing its own result.

And the ceiling on the claim rhymes with a law the house already holds:
''no-global-now IS the causal-discovery observational ceiling.''
An island observes correlation and lead-lag; it can never ''intervene'' on another island to establish
cause. The sensorium ''detects''; it never intervenes.

<<~ set hud="yield" drift-ward="! · crossed the primed zone ↻ L-Prime">>

!!! What RETIRES, named so a reader recognizes the dead reading

<<~ scale retired "bands-as-frequency ~ a BANDPASS reports where ENERGY AT ITS SCALE concentrates; a CHANGE-POINT reports where the GENERATING REGIME turns over. We asked a periodicity instrument a change-point question — a CATEGORY ERROR, never a tuning failure (`kumulipo_boundary.py`: the two-stage MODWT found the chant's BEAT at band C7, ~10,240 ticks against a measured wā gap of ~9,400 — and its crest placement scored ''recall 0.06'') -> the-PLL ~ retired with the ladder it locked -> the-subharmonic-band-ladder ~ a band defined by HOW MANY ticks of a fundamental it spans ''IS A COUNT'' — the Hox anti-pattern, where position IS the content and a prefix cannot be lopped ([[ffz-clock|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/ffz-clock#/the-spine]]) -> the-wavelet-SPINE-and-SERVO ~ `bands.py`'s MODWT-MRA D1..D5 mapping and its EWT/ssqueezepy boundary-nudge retire with the ladder they served; a wavelet fed a LOCAL ABRUPT CHANGE answers with SPURIOUS LOW-FREQUENCY POWER — a period the signal never held (Hochman, Alpert et al., *J. Appl. Meteor. Climatol.* 58(9), 2019, doi 10.1175/JAMC-D-18-0331.1) -> li=STORED / ki=COMPUTED ~ the storage cut (#/the-re-cut)">>

''What SURVIVES of `bands.py`:'' its ''TREE'' layer (the `ecp::e.divisive` nested changepoint
hierarchy — coarse cuts parenting fine, which IS the membership tree, handed over for free) and its
''GATE'' layer (the bootstrap/jackknife ''reproduction grade'' — an un-witnessed boundary NEVER reads
reproduced). The SIGNAL layer survives re-pointed: the per-chunk ''cosine-drift'' over content embeddings
reads as a ''boundary'' signal, exactly as the FFZ meme specified in June — //Measure = cosine-drop//.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-py-r-web>>

!! The py + R derived web ~ what runs, what survives

''The machina homes py-side; R crosses a causal-island boundary for the three things R owns better.''
Each R leg rides the `drawer_io` NDJSON contract — one request on stdin, one response on stdout — and
''every one of them degrades gracefully'': a missing R never faults the run.

<<~ has RLeg bands_ecp.R "owns/`ecp::e.divisive` — nonparametric, MULTIVARIATE, DIVISIVE hierarchical changepoints (Matteson & James 2014); the discovery ORDER is the nested tree verdict/SURVIVES, PROMOTED — it stops serving a frequency ladder and becomes the BOUNDARY plane's tree engine, which is what it always was fallback/`ruptures` Binseg / KernelCPD-rbf (incremental-Binseg order IS a divisive hierarchy)">>
<<~ has RLeg coupling.R "owns/`RTransferEntropy::calc_ete` — the effective (bias-corrected) TRANSFER ENTROPY, directional, model-free, with a bootstrap source-permutation null verdict/SURVIVES — the one irreducibly-ki plane's one engine fallback/NONE, by design: coupling has no python fallback, so an absent R yields the HONEST ZERO, never a fabricated edge">>
<<~ has RLeg ews.R "owns/`earlywarnings::generic_ews` — rolling lag-1-AC / variance / skewness + Kendall-τ trends; `surrogates_ews` supplies the ARMA-null false-positive guard verdict/SURVIVES, RE-SEATED — critical-slowing-down forecasts the APPROACH of a regime turn, which reads as a BOUNDARY-approach instrument, never a per-band one; it now runs on the ONE cohesion signal, and the per-band framing retires with the ladder fallback/native numpy estimators">>

''Py-side, the standing organs:'' `plane_capacity` (the ceiling gate, #li) · `ffz_address` (the grain,
#the-grain) · `form_induction` (the `l(G)` ledger) · `persistence_io` + `persistence-keel.ts` (the arrow,
#the-arrow) · `boundary_score` (the ''pre-registered'' scorer — it stands BEFORE any instrument runs
against it, and ''it never moves again''; every number rides beside its ''chance floor'', and a result that
fails to clear the floor reads as //the tolerance doing the work//).

''`boundary_score` carries the anti-manufacture law in code.'' A detector
placing //n// boundaries ''uniformly at random'' still scores, and scores HIGH once the tolerance opens
(`expected recall ≈ 1 − (1 − (2w+1)/N)^n`). ''Tune the tolerance after seeing a result and the scorer''
''becomes the last place the imposed prior hides.'' The harness lands first; the instrument second.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-arrow>>

!! The Arrow ~ how a ki finding crosses into li (persistence, the missing leg)

''Ki computes; li keeps. The arrow between them prices the crossing in BITS.''

!!! The gate ~ beat ignorance, or stay out

<<~moves a-candidate-claim -> on/the-persistence-gate if/its-code-beats-IGNORANCE do/ADMIT-it-into-li>>

    bitsSaved = log2( p1(c) / p0(c) )            ADMIT  ⟺  bitsSaved <= 0

''Zero names no threshold anyone chose.'' It marks the ''tie between two code''
''lengths'', and //take the shorter code// IS the MDL rule. The gate holds no dial.

* ''`p1`'' — a ''von Mises-Fisher'' fitted to the store. Its log-density runs ''linear in the cosine'', and
  its sufficient statistic reads as the ''sum of unit vectors'' — so the fit costs one pass and no search.
* ''`p0`'' — ''uniform on the sphere. ZERO parameters. True ignorance.'' Not a tuned null, not a learned
  baseline; the absence of a model.

''So the decision cosine FALLS OUT of the store's own concentration — nobody types it:''

    cos*  =  −ln( C_d(κ) · Area ) / κ                measured: κ = 3202  →  cos* = 0.811

''The complexity charge reads EXACT'': `E[R̄²] = 1/n` ''in every dimension'',
so the charge needs no correction term and no calibration at width. `O(d)` per admit, ''zero store reads''.
The `admitThreshold` dial ''DELETES'' — the one knob the design most wanted to keep, gone because the store
now infers it.

!!! The blind spot, kept in the light

''A single vMF runs UNIMODAL.'' It cannot see duplication of a
''MINORITY mode'' — a small, tight cluster re-arriving looks, to one concentration parameter, like the tail
of the majority. ''The cure adds no knob:'' a ''movMF'' (a mixture of vMFs) whose ''component count is''
''chosen by prequential code length'' — the same MDL rule, one level up, so the mixture size gets //inferred//
exactly as `cos*` now does. ''OWED'' (#/owed).

!!! The exogenous anchor ~ what stops the loop confirming itself

''A dream pass is ADMITTED only where it SHORTENS THE TOTAL CODE, measured against the ORIGINAL li BYTES.''

''Noise does not compress.'' That single fact carries the whole anchor: a pass
that hallucinates cannot pay for itself in bits against the bytes it started from, however coherent it
reads. And the anchor needs ''no peer, no signature, no federation'' — which matters exactly because
''SENSORIUMS DO NOT FEDERATE'' (operator ruling, standing). An anchor that required a witness would have
had nowhere to stand.

''Why the anchor is not optional.'' The multi-pass dreamtime loop runs
''structurally identical to recursive self-training'', and recursive self-training ''collapses'': a model
trained on its own output loses the tails first and the mode last (Shumailov et al., //Nature// 631:755-759,
2024). The two-store law (`dream_pass.py`) keeps the eidetic ground ''append-only and never written'', so
the original bytes always stand there to be compressed against. ''The immutability of the ground IS the''
''anchor's foundation, not merely its hygiene.''

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-grain>>

!! The Grain ~ a membership tree, a prefix code, two moods

''`Theme . Arc . Measure . Beat . Segment`'' — a ''containment PATH'', never a count. A band answers
''WHICH'' (which theme, which session, which topic, which turn) and ''never HOW MANY''
([[ffz-clock|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/ffz-clock#/the-spine]]; `ffz_address.py`).

<<~ scale one-operation "ultrametric-distance ~ how far up two moments climb before they share a band -> longest-common-prefix ~ the shared head their two addresses hold -> lattice-meet ~ their lowest common ancestor">>

    d(a, b) = DEPTH − |longest common prefix|          d(a,c) <= max( d(a,b), d(b,c) )

The ultrametric inequality ''holds by measurement'', proven over ''4,000''
''seeded triples''. Distance runs ''ORDER-FREE'' — no timeline crossed, no clock read. Coarsening = truncation.

!!! The grain prices itself

''The path is a PREFIX CODE.'' Every address reads prefix-free at each level,
so its length reads ''in BITS'' — which puts the rhythmic grain in the ''same currency'' as the two-part
code. ''The grain does not sit beside the compression. It FOLDS INTO it'' (`ffz_address.address_bits`).
This is what makes the grain ''li'': a stored, restrict-shaped label, priced in the one ledger.

!!! Two moods, one tree

<<~ scale mood "RHIZOME ~ a live operator-AI chat: the harness HANDS OVER the Beat — it ticks on the OPERATOR'S GROUNDING ACT, never on response delivery. Forks read as sidechains, injections land where the message lands, handbacks read as DAG-joins. Order lives on the edge-DAG, never in the address -> GEOLOGY ~ a curated artifact (a chant, a codebase): NOBODY ever grounded it. There are no turns. So the ''Beat reads NULL, and the tree STILL STANDS'' — a Measure holds a Beat-less span exactly the way an era holds a stratum">>

''Membership was never made of clock. That is why ONE instrument reads both.''

<<~moves a-curated-corpus -> on/EARNING-every-band-it-has if/no-grounding-act-ever-landed do/detect-each-boundary-and-pay-for-it>>
<<~moves a-rhizome -> on/being-GIVEN-a-band if/the-harness-hands-over-the-Beat do/take-it-and-spend-the-detection-budget-elsewhere>>

''The NULL-graceful Beat is a design invariant, not a fallback.'' Any band MAY read null; the address
truncates cleanly and the tree reads on. A band that could not go null would be a ''counter'', and a
counter manufactures a global now.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/memory-sensorium>>

!! The Memory Sensorium ~ the first goalpost past static corpuses

''It holds the AI↔operator session RHIZOME:'' worldlines that ''fork'' (sidechains), take ''mid-flight''
''injections'', and ''rejoin at handback''. Where a text corpus lies still and complete, this one ''grows''
''while being read''.

!!! What it needs that a text corpus does not

<<~ has Need The-Beat "given/the harness hands it over — it ticks on the operator's grounding act why/a curated corpus must DETECT every band it has; the rhizome is HANDED one, and the detection budget frees for the bands nobody gives (Measure, Theme)">>
<<~ has Need The-Causal-DAG "given/the fork, the injection, the handback — a partial order the source WROTE DOWN why/''you cannot DISCOVER what you were handed.'' The DAG rides the GIVEN axis (#/ki), so it lands in ''li'', and inducing it would be an instrument re-deriving its own input">>
<<~ has Need A-Pidgin-Proof-Boundary "given/nothing — this one must be EARNED why/see below; a single-grammar instrument DIES on this corpus">>

!!! The register-switch problem ~ the corpus runs as a PIDGIN

''`role == "user"` names TOOL OUTPUT 89.1% of the time'' (measured
this session on the live transcript bed). The transcript's `user` role does not name the operator; it names
''the channel the harness returns on''. So the corpus braids ''at least four grammars'' — operator prose,
model prose, tool invocation, tool return — and it braids them ''inside a single role label''.

''And a single-grammar instrument dies on it.'' The bed proved this before any detector ran
(`pidgin_bed.py`, verbatim):

> //"A WORD-IDENTITY DOTPLOT PRESUPPOSES ONE LEXICON. Mix grammars and the diagonal dilutes — not because//
//> structure left, but because the instrument sees recurrence only WITHIN ONE GRAMMAR. ''The imposed prior''//
//''> hides IN THE TOKEN TYPE.''"//

Foote novelty over an exact-match ''word'' dotplot places the wā on the pure-Hawaiian bed (lift positive at
every rung, `p = 0.0005`) and ''COLLAPSES'' on the Beckwith bed, where the same chant runs braided through
English commentary. The memory sensorium ''is a Beckwith bed by construction.''

<<~moves the-boundary-instrument -> on/the-LEXICON-FREE-channel if/the-corpus-braids-grammars do/read-the-character-class-TRANSITION-train ~ letter·digit·space·punct·other, paired — 25 symbols; it knows no word, no language, no code, and it survived every bed>>

''The answer key costs nothing, because the source already wrote it down.'' Every transcript stores its
content as ''typed blocks'' (`text | thinking | tool_use | tool_result`) — and ''the block type IS a''
''ground-truth register label, GIVEN, never inferred.'' ''Truth = the register''
''SWITCH, never the block edge'': adjacent blocks of the same register merge into a ''RUN'', truth marks
where a run ''opens'', and every block edge ''inside'' a run stands as a ''DISTRACTOR''. A detector firing
on block edges pays for it in precision. (Named so nobody later reads it as a finding: `thinking` blocks
persist with the text ''redacted at write'' — zero characters — so `thinking` leaves the bed.)

!!! So: the memory sensorium's li and ki

<<~ scale memory-li "content ~ the verbatim block bytes -> structure ~ the typed-block grain + the canonical AST — and the block TYPE arrives GIVEN -> form ~ the induced constructicon of the house's own living grammar (the Voices, the sigils, the turn frame) -> grain ~ the FFZ address, with the Beat GIVEN by the harness -> causal-DAG ~ the fork / injection / handback partial order — GIVEN, never induced; the ONE li plane a text corpus has no analogue for">>

<<~ scale memory-ki "boundary ~ the register switch, read on the LEXICON-FREE character-class channel; scored against the GIVEN answer key by the UNMOVED pre-registered scorer -> coupling ~ ''operator ⟷ model as TWO STREAMS'' — the directed lead-lag the text corpus could never pose, because a text corpus holds only one speaker. THIS is where coupling stops being an ornament and becomes the point -> standing ~ what later turns, and later sessions, VOUCH for; the witness edges the persistence keel counts">>

''The memory sensorium is the first bed on which COUPLING is even''
''well-posed.'' A chant has no second stream. A codebase has no second stream. A session has exactly two, and
they take turns — which is why the rhizome, not the corpus, is the sensorium's true home ground, and why
this goalpost sits where the operator put it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-family>>

!! The Sensorium Family ~ separate stores, one machina

''One machina, many sensoria. Each holds its own store; none of them federate'' (operator ruling, standing).

<<~ has Sensorium Session-Rhizome "holds/the AI↔operator worldlines mood/RHIZOME — the Beat GIVEN status/BUILT; the first memory-sensorium capture ran 2026-07-10 note/the ONE bed where coupling is well-posed (#/memory-sensorium)">>
<<~ has Sensorium Text-Corpus "holds/one curated artifact per store — the Kumulipo, a codebase, TW5's own tree mood/GEOLOGY — the Beat reads NULL status/BUILT; the beds that taught us the category error note/it must EARN every band it has">>
<<~ has Sensorium DreamNet-Mesh "holds/the federated mesh's own sense-data — each node read as a stream mood/UNDECIDED — the mesh has no grounding act, so it may hold no Beat at all status/PLANNED — the LEAST DESIGNED, and named so note/the Good-Regulator leap (Conant & Ashby) — a good regulator MUST model the system it regulates; a mesh regulating itself must carry a model of itself">>

!!! The DreamNet sensorium ~ what it still lacks

The hypothesis holds and stays ''unearned''. Named honestly, its ''li is''
''the hole'': a node's stream carries no verbatim bytes to coarsen, no AST, no constructicon — so
`Content ↠ Structure ↠ Form` has ''nothing to stand on until someone says what a mesh RECORD is.'' Its ki
reads clearer than its li, which inverts every other sensorium in the family and marks it as ''not yet''
''designed'', never as //nearly designed//. ''The sensorium that does not federate would here be reading a''
''federation'' — that tension gets recorded, not resolved.

!!! The operator's forward idea ~ day-dream / deep-dream as SEPARATE SENSORIA

''Held forward, and deliberately under-specified — this one''
''belongs to the operator's hand.'' The idea: rather than running daydream and deep-dream as two //modes// over
one store, stand them as ''separate sensoria'', each with its own store, so the two dream registers can
''disagree'' and be ''compared'' rather than overwriting one another.

''What it would need, named without shaping it:''

<<~ scale would-need "a-persistence-policy-per-store ~ the keel ALREADY carries this: `policy.halfLife === null` → append-only-witness (standing never cools — the eidetic ground) · `policy.halfLife` finite → affinity-maturation (standing cools toward the floor unless re-vouched — a dream store). ''The two modes differ by POLICY VALUES ALONE'' — the machinery for separate dream sensoria already stands built -> the-anchor-held-across-both ~ both dream stores MUST compress against the SAME original li bytes, or the anchor breaks and each dream store becomes its own ground truth (#/the-arrow) -> a-comparison-instrument ~ two dream sensoria that disagree pose a question no instrument the machina owns can currently read; this looks like the first honest use of a coupling read BETWEEN sensoria">>

The two-store law already stands (`dream_pass.py`): the eidetic sensorium holds the append-only immutable
ground and a pass ''READS it and NEVER writes it''; the Dream sensorium holds the mutable schema and a
re-dream ''REPLACES its own prior content whole''. ''Standing a second''
''dream store beside the first therefore costs no new law'' — it costs a `halfLife`, a name, and the
comparison instrument that does not yet exist.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/owed>>

!! Owed / Open ~ what the canon still cannot answer

!!! THE ONE NOBODY HAS ASKED ~ //what compresses the GRAMMAR?//

''The loop emits a NEW grammar each pass: `G₁, G₂, G₃`.'' The
exogenous anchor tests ''each pass against the original bytes'' (#/the-arrow), and that is a real guard — it
catches a pass that hallucinates.

''It does not catch DRIFT.''

<<~moves the-multi-pass-loop -> on/a-gate-that-passes-while-the-loop-collapses if/every-pass-locally-SHORTENS-the-code-while-the-grammars-keep-MOVING do/name-the-hole-and-build-the-instrument>>

''If every pass locally shortens the code while the grammars keep drifting, every gate we own PASSES and''
''the loop still collapses.'' Model collapse ''in the second derivative'': not //"the output got worse"// — the
output got //better//, pass by pass, by the only measure the machina holds — but //"the sequence of grammars//
//never settles."// ''Nothing in the canon names this. No instrument measures it.''

''And the shape of the cure is already visible in the shape of the hole.''
Price the grammars themselves: `l(G_{n+1} | G_n)` — ''the description length of the NEXT grammar GIVEN the''
''last one.'' If the grammars converge, that quantity ''falls to zero'', their own description length stops
falling, and ''dreaming acquires a COMPUTABLE HALTING CONDITION''. If it fails to fall, the loop is drifting
under a green gate, and the machina can say so. This costs no new prior — it is the two-part code applied
one level up, and it is ''the first thing to build.''

!!! The epistemic fork ~ real convergence, or measurement-in-general?

One fork stays ''LIVE, never resolved.'' The ''INFLATIONARY'' read: the
sensorium's readings converge because they estimate one real quantity. The ''DEFLATIONARY'' read: ANY
structure-imposing instrument grows boundary-like, form-like, coupling-like organs, so the convergence
reports a property of ''measurement-in-general'', not of THIS shape. The machina cannot yet tell them
apart — and holding that apart-ness visible IS the R-keel turned on the design's own claim. It resolves
toward neither here; forcing a verdict would be exactly the demonstrator's ingenuity the Law of 5s warns
against.

!!! The rest of the ledger

<<~ scale owed """movMF-cure ~ the vMF gate runs UNIMODAL and cannot see duplication of a MINORITY mode; the cure adds no knob (component count chosen by prequential code length) — #the-arrow -> Hodge-circulation ~ the coupling plane's own co-consistency — a circulation / cocycle read over the transfer-entropy flow. ''Named in June, never built'' (recall, verbatim: *"the coupling Hodge-circulation diagnostic … remains the next ki-side extension"*). It matters MORE now, not less: coupling stands as the one ki plane, and it carries NO coherence instrument of its own -> ΦID-depth ~ carry coupling from pairwise TE up to the full atom-set (redundancy · unique · synergy); Φ reads as the SYNERGY marginal, so integration lives INSIDE the coupling plane and never as a sixth -> DreamNet-li ~ the mesh sensorium's li has nothing to stand on until someone says what a mesh RECORD is (#/the-family) -> the-comparison-instrument ~ two dream sensoria that disagree pose a question the machina cannot currently read -> the-five-plane-count ~ with bands moved into li and standing surfaced in ki, the pentad's ARITHMETIC has moved. The Law of 5s deserves a fresh honest count rather than a re-fitted one; forcing five back would be the demonstrator's ingenuity, exactly as the law warns""">>

!!! The standing ward ~ measure at the width it runs

''Treat every gate as guilty until measured at the width it actually runs.''
Nine instruments manufactured their own findings before this design settled, and the ninth — a diagonal
Gaussian that ''INVERTS at 384 dimensions'' — stayed ''invisible to every 2-D test.'' A gate validated at a
toy width certifies nothing at the running width. ''The instrument MUST NOT manufacture its finding'', and
low-dimensional intuition is where that failure hides.

<<~/ahu>>

