!! The Geometry ~ ground + lattice, the chain as spine

The machina reads ''one GROUND'' (verbatim bytes + position; the identity partition, what every reading reads) through a ''LATTICE of readings carrying one proven chain'' — the li spine:

<<~ scale li-spine "ground ~ verbatim bytes + position; append-only, never carries derived -> shape-reading ~ the expression-variance quotient (canonical parse shape + structural hash); the collision-rate + subsample instruments read whether it coarsens or canonicalizes -> idiom-reading ~ recurrence-of-shape templates, MDL-priced; recurrence, never meaning">>

The ''MEANING BRAID'' (three strata, three warrants: DECLARED ~ registry fiat · ENACTED ~ witnessed execution · USED ~ bit-priced distribution, the vMF reading) rides a SECOND lattice axis — the Equitz–Cover admission test holds it off the chain (cross-shape synonymy never factors through the shape hash). The ''CONSTRUCTICON JOIN'' (idiom × meaning-braid, the lattice join) names the unbuilt plane.

The grammar CLASS names the description-language knob — fixed AND reported, sensitivity measured (the gap-witness pattern, generalized); the cut-by-code-length law carries the Vereshchagin–Vitanyi proofs. H1 holds its seats at FEDERATION boundaries, the li/ki cross-cover, and the ki side's own aperture-cover (an obstruction class rides as a first-class reading — contextuality measured, never averaged away).

''The KI WING'' reads one undifferentiated flow per worldline through first-class APERTURES — a reading names the pair (flow, focus) with its watermark, composed as nameless entities with `#has` stacks: reading · aperture (admissibility-checked; grain = support × locus, a cover never a chain) · obstruction-reading · invariants-ledger · trust-valuation (standing — discount-and-fuse algebra, the site's lighting, beside the apertures never among them). Named apertures: boundary (anytime-valid martingale) · the three coupling focusings (surrogate-ETE · Gaussian cTE · salience-fusion), each claiming directed predictive dependence only. Empty seats held: value/preference · provenance. Full law: [[li-ki-integrities|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/li-ki-integrities#/the-flow-and-apertures]].

Members + grounds: [[living-grammar-palace|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/living-grammar-palace#/ground-and-readings]] · [[li-ki-integrities|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/li-ki-integrities#/the-lattice]] · hearth memories `li-chain-research-braid` + `ki-side-research-braid`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/grounds>>

!! Grounds ~ the cited names the design stands on

The two-part code and the three ki readings rest on named prior
art, one line per warrant: ''predictive-information / excess-entropy'' (Bialek, Nemenman & Tishby) names
the one quantity every li plane estimates a facet of · the ''ε-machine'' (Crutchfield, computational
mechanics) gives FORM its exact formal twin, the minimal generating machine · ''critical-slowing-down''
(Scheffer et al., early-warning signals) grounds the ews.R boundary-approach instrument (#/the-py-r-web) ·
''Integrated Information Decomposition'' (Mediano, Rosas et al.) carries coupling to full depth, Φ the
synergy marginal · and divination's oldest discipline — a reading is a HYPOTHESIS surfaced for the
querent, never a verdict — grounds the confidence/Cup humility the coupling ward already runs. Five deep
domains once read this one instrument in five dialects; the design keeps their citations, never their
five-plane count (#owed, the-five-plane-count).

